WEBVTT

00:00:00.609 --> 00:00:01.899
Open a private retaining wall study. Change the interior post spacing to 1500 mm. The program recalculates the schedule for every entered backfill.

00:00:01.899 --> 00:00:06.957
At 1800 mm retained height in the trial clay, inspect the 200UB18.2 post and the 600 mm pier, 2.9 m deep. Steel embedment is 1.2 m. The candidate cage is 12-N12.

00:00:06.957 --> 00:00:14.108
Compare lateral moment and shear for all nine combinations. The LC9 base moment is 42.867 kNm. The engineer must verify the ground, support and detailing assumptions.

00:00:14.108 --> 00:00:20.581
Read the full calculation book. Each backfill has a post and pier schedule, a moment–height chart, service displacement checks and the complete action tables.

00:00:20.581 --> 00:00:26.378
Issue the saved revision in Project Summary. The chapter records the input basis, identifies missing soil data and includes the calculation appendix.
